comments[3]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-22T10:32:00.245Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: all-status searches for exact 4.10.2 and 4.23.15 found only prior intake comments on pm-mwdout and this delivery. Full closed pm-mwdout and pm-k47gdd records distinguish earlier shipped action/tsx updates from this newly admitted patch pair. Disposable pnpm 11.10.0 install succeeds with the existing workspace configuration and both package engines retain Node >=22.18 support."
  "2026-09-22T10:33:58.650Z","harness:codex","Admission proof: disposable project pins this repository packageManager pnpm@11.10.0 and copies its complete pnpm-workspace.yaml without modification. Exact fast-check 4.10.2 and tsx 4.23.15 resolution succeeds. Their published Node requirements are >=12.17 and >=18 respectively, within the supported >=22.18 floor. Wait for the current coverage process to exit before replacing installed dependencies."
  "2026-09-22T10:37:57.741Z","harness:codex","Implementation and acceptance: fast-check 4.10.2 and tsx 4.23.15 installed under pnpm 11.10.0 without policy exceptions. Lockfile changes include their expected peer snapshots and Vite reusing already-present picomatch 4.0.7. All 30 linked fuzz/property tests pass; typecheck and the TypeScript source-quality gate pass; tsx 4.23.15 executes the source CLI version command. Audit: zero vulnerabilities across 422 dependencies. The preceding unchanged-source full run passed 9202 tests at exact 100/100/100/100; final hosted coverage on this lockfile is required before merge."
